      "updated": 1793700117302,
      "created": 1793699540635,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement\n1. User should be able to submit task (Fixed/Scheduled) in the Scheduler.\n2. Task should be executed on their executionTime.\n3. Task must be submitted within 5 min before its execution time.\n\n\n\nNon Functional Requirement -\n1. Scalablity - System should be able to scalre millions of tasks.\n2. Task should be durable and should not get missed.\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement\n1. User should be able to submit task (Fixed/Scheduled) in the Scheduler.\n2. Task should be executed on their executionTime.\n3. Task must be submitted within 5 min before its execution time.\n\n\n\nNon Functional Requirement -\n1. Scalablity - System should be able to scalre millions of tasks.\n2. Task should be durable and should not get missed.\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
