      "created": 1793700292425,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Fixed Task\n1. TaskId\n2. Execution Time (indexed)\n3. Task Definition.\n\nScheduled Task\n1. TaskId\n2. Scheduled Time - {Frequency - Day/Hour, ExecutionTime - 00:00AM}\n3. Task Definition.\n\nExecution (partitioned by hours/Daily)\n1. ExecutionId\n2. TaskId\n3. Task Type - Fixed/Schedule\n4. ExecutionTime (indexed)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Fixed Task\n1. TaskId\n2. Execution Time (indexed)\n3. Task Definition.\n\nScheduled Task\n1. TaskId\n2. Scheduled Time - {Frequency - Day/Hour, ExecutionTime - 00:00AM}\n3. Task Definition.\n\nExecution (partitioned by hours/Daily)\n1. ExecutionId\n2. TaskId\n3. Task Type - Fixed/Schedule\n4. ExecutionTime (indexed)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
